{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"armour_leather","model_identifier":"armour_leather","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## armour_leather\n\nArmour set, leather.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -11.8..11.8, y 21.5..51.4, z -5.2..5.2 (size 23.7 x 29.9 x 10.5 u = 67 x 84 x 30 cm).\nHardened, moulded brown leather: a cuirass with stitched horizontal bands and a front seam (on `torso`, inflate 0.5), a strip skirt of four hanging panels (front, back, sides) to mid-thigh on `hips` (inflate 0.5; the panels are split so the legs swing between them), and shoulder caps on `arm_upper_r/l` (inflate 0.85 so they sit over the cuirass edge). Bones and pivots are a copy of warrior_base; merge each cube into the same-named bone. A team-colour belt sash (`team_sash`, RGB 52, 96, 178) is worn over the armour so the unit keeps its team colour.\n"},"description":"## armour_leather\n\nArmour set, leather.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -11.8..11.8, y 21.5..51.4, z -5.2..5.2 (size 23.7 x 29.9 x 10.5 u = 67 x 84 x 30 cm).\nHardened, moulded brown leather: a cuirass with stitched horizontal bands and a front seam (on `torso`, inflate 0.5), a strip skirt of four hanging panels (front, back, sides) to mid-thigh on `hips` (inflate 0.5; the panels are split so the legs swing between them), and shoulder caps on `arm_upper_r/l` (inflate 0.85 so they sit over the cuirass edge). Bones and pivots are a copy of warrior_base; merge each cube into the same-named bone. A team-colour belt sash (`team_sash`, RGB 52, 96, 178) is worn over the armour so the unit keeps its team colour.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"cuirass","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","